==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is much harder then the other Tag Arena stages. [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie units]] with the [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer ability]] are highly recommended to deal with Lord Gravey. Remember that [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can deal a good amount of damage to Lord Gravey, but Celeboodle's attack may kill him early on.

